### Dated: 09-26-2025
### Description: Use this script to test the MCP Server

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3333
@contentType = application/json

### Request list of tools from the MCP server
GET {{baseUrl}}/tools/list

### Get tool details
GET {{baseUrl}}/tools/echo

### Invoke 'echo' tool on the server
POST {{baseUrl}}/tools/call
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "tool": "echo",
  "input": {
    "text": "Hello World!"
  }
}

### Invoke 'counter_stream' tool on the server
POST {{baseUrl}}/tools/call
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "tool": "counter_stream",
  "input": {
    "count": 5,
    "interval_ms": 5000
  }
}